summary:
I triaged 158 findings from 9 auditors and checked the contested ones against plane-visual-reference.md, ui.md, PLAN.md, the as-built docs and the code. I also checked the 4 known leftovers in code, and all 4 are real: WorkspaceViewsScreen passes no drag prop to ViewRow; the menu Move up/Down in ViewMenu, StatesSettings, LabelsSettings and PageRowMenu calls the action without applyMove; operations.md:104 records the gantt Today and dates buttons as 28px; SeriesCharts tables use no table-widths floors.

Result: 99 fix items, one per root cause, in severity order (21 high, 44 medium, 34 low). I rejected 4 findings: 1 is intended behaviour and 3 conflict with the Density rule in ui.md. I moved 3 findings to needs_decision.

Shared root causes, fixed once in the shell lane:
- a coarse-pointer touch-size rule for Astryx controls across the whole theme (S1);
- a fallback focus ring plus accent-color for focusable elements that are not Astryx components (S5);
- an inset ListItem focus ring, so flush lists no longer clip it (S6);
- one shared header tab-strip pattern: docked on the hairline, first tab on the 16px inset, a two-row layout below 600px with 44px tabs (S7).
Lane items build on these.

Duplicates merged:
- list-1 with planning-2 (FilterBar token overflow);
- board-table-4 with planning-16 (Name column);
- planning-13 with workspace-9 (clipped row ring);
- detail-2 with detail-8 (sub-item props);
- list-11 with detail-19 (label overflow);
- the tab-inset findings settings-2, settings-3, workspace-5, planning-8 and pages-15.

Lane moves by file ownership: shell-13 and shell-14 go to planning (CreateProjectDialog is in projects/); workspace-2 and workspace-3 go to settings (profile/); workspace-4 goes to detail (ai-surfaces.css); detail-7 goes to pages (editor.css).

Touch-target findings are rated high, because the brief defines high as anything under 44px at 375. How to apply 44px is in needs_decision.

I did not start a server: every surviving finding had numeric evidence in results.json or extra*.json that matched the code I read (for example the gantt connector svg has top:0/bottom:0 and no height, and table.css has no row-level stopPropagation for the selection cell).
